            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An apparatus to facilitate memory tiling is disclosed. The apparatus includes a memory, one or more execution units (EUs) to execute a plurality of processing threads via access to the memory and tiling logic to apply a tiling pattern to memory addresses for data stored in the memory.</p>
